        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/pershing_oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Pershing sits on territory that was part of the Osage Indian Reservation starting in 1872.",
